    "description": "Enjoy the sea of books with BloomHut. From romance to fantasy, from history to sci-fi, from human to werewolf, from paranormal to unban realistic, Download BloomHut now!\r\n\r\nDetailed classification\r\nBloomHut divides the books on the platform into multiple categories and explains in detail the books to which the categories belong, so that you can quickly find the categories and books you want.\r\n\r\nReading settings\r\nUsers can adjust the reading font size, font type, and paragraph spacing according to their reading preferences. Adjustable brightness and background make you read comfortably.\r\n\r\nReading benefits\r\nWe will provide you with different types of reading benefits to help you read; for example: sign-in rewards, reading task rewards, so that you can enjoy reading while also getting a sense of accomplishment from reading.",
